# Production native controls, fake host only. Skip is an answer: no real runner or owner action.
fold folded
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
shell am start -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --es waitingQuestion strict
clearlog
expect Questions waiting
expect answer questions
expect skip
nolog waiting question answer
shot question-card-cover-skip
# The card's skip asks first (Boss, 2026-10-29): keep it leaves the question waiting.
tap skip
expect Skip this question?
shot question-card-cover-skip-confirm
tap keep it
absent Skip this question?
expect Questions waiting
expect answer questions
nolog Boss skipped this question
tap skip
expect Skip this question?
tap skip it
absent Questions waiting
expect skipped
log Boss skipped this question
shot question-card-cover-skipped
fold unfolded
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
shell am start -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --es waitingQuestion codex
clearlog
tap answer questions
expect Before I continue
expect Send answers
expect skip
nolog waiting question answer
shot question-form-inner-skip
tap skip
absent Questions waiting
absent Before I continue
expect skipped
log Boss skipped this question
shot question-form-inner-skipped
[phone] After promotion and matching runner update: one harmless AskUserQuestion from a Mac and one from a phone builder, with no options selected and Other forbidden. Tap skip from the card/form. Verify the waiting tool receives the fixed delegation answer for every question once, continues its existing turn (no deny/stop/new queued chat), and pending/card/notification/Needs-you count clear on phone and Soma desktop. Other devices show skipped after the approval_result event. Do not answer real work questions during this test.
[phone] Check two question cards at once, wrong/expired nonce, locked device and a transport failure. Skip must affect only its own nonce; failure leaves the card and draft with an error/retry; double tap or a competing desktop answer must not deliver twice. Verify skip is reachable on cover, unfolded and desktop even with no answer selected.
